OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fat first on Tuesday, with showers
OL,7,Flikely developing later. Unsettled
OL,8,Fmidweek, with a risk of heavy rain and
OL,9,Fthunderstorms. Warmer and more humid
OL,10,Ffor a time.
